  "job_B3.2.11.5_20251003_114612": {
    "text": "Bro\u00f0or \u00fea leofestan, ic cy\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fereo \u00feing synt \u00e6rest on foreweardum \u00e6ghwylcum men nydbehefe to\nI is geleafa, o\u00f0er is hiht, \u00feridde so\u00f0 lufu.\nOn \u00f0am geleafan is \u00fe\u00e6t he gelyfe on God, f\u00e6der \u00e6lmihtigne, & on sunu & on \u00feone halgan gast & on \u00fea\n\u00deonne is se hiht \u00fe\u00e6t he wislice gehihte \u00fea ecan meda.\n\u00deonne is seo so\u00f0e lufu \u00fe\u00e6t he sie gefylled mid \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan lufan & his nehstan.\nFor \u00feam \u00fee we sint ealle on \u00feam fulluhte Godes bearn gehalgode, to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t we sien gastlice gebro\u00f0or\n\u00d0y we sceolon symle wunian on \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan lufan & ures nehstan, \u00fe\u00e6t he symle on us \u00feurhwunige,\nBro\u00f0or mine, VI \u00feing synt nydebehefe to habbanne \u00fe\u00e6re halgan cristenlican \u00e6wf\u00e6stnesse & ealra m\u00e6st\nI is andetnes, o\u00f0er is hreowsung, \u00feridde is w\u00e6cce, feor\u00fee is f\u00e6sten, V sint gebedu, VI is \u00e6lmesse.\nSio andetnes is to donne be eallum \u00feam sinnum \u00fee man aw\u00f0er \u00feurhtyh\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e an ge\u00feohte o\u00f0\u00f0e on\nWitodlice eahta synt heafodleahtras, butan \u00feara sumon ne m\u00e6g \u00e6nig man unea\u00f0lice gemet bion.\n\u00c6rest is \u00fe\u00e6t forme gifernes \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6re wambe frecnes, o\u00f0er is dyrne geligre, \u00feridde is sleacmodnes &\n\u00deurh \u00fea oferhygde of heofonum gehreas \u00fe\u00e6t wundorlice engla gesceaft.\nBro\u00f0or mine, \u00feonne ge rihtre andetnesse to eowrum scriftum becumen, \u00feonne sceal he eow geornlice\nHe sceall hine eac swa l\u00e6ran \u00fe\u00e6t he of \u00feam \u00feweorlicum ge\u00feohtum andetnesse do, & he sceal hine\nFor \u00feam \u00fee God wilna\u00fe ure andetnesse to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6bbe rihtne intingan us to forgifanne, for \u00feam\n\u00c6ghwylc hyht forgifnesse on \u00fe\u00e6re andetnesse forstent.\nSio andetnes is mildheortnesse worc.\nHio is h\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s untruman, & hio is l\u00e6cedom ura m\u00e6gena mid hreowsunge, for \u00fean we on o\u00f0re wisan ne\nBe \u00fe\u00e6ra synna andettnesse Salomon cw\u00e6\u00f0: se \u00f0e his scylda gehyde\u00f0, ne bi\u00f0 he na geriht.\nSe \u00f0e so\u00f0lice hie geandet & hie \u00feonne forl\u00e6t, se bi\u00f0 mildheortnesse begytend.\nBro\u00f0or mine, \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re andetnesse to underfonne is sio hreowsung.\nBe \u00fe\u00e6re se h\u00e6lend cw\u00e6\u00f0 on \u00feam godspelle: Do\u00f0 hreowsunge, for \u00feam heofona rice neal\u00e6ce\u00f0.\n& Iohannes se fulluhtre cw\u00e6\u00f0: Wyrcea\u00fe medeme w\u00e6stmas hreowsunge.\n\u00de\u00e6t is se medema w\u00e6stm hreowsunge \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00fea for\u00fegewitenan synna bewepe & \u00fea ilcan eft ne\nAc dryhten \u00feurh Esaiam \u00feone witigan cw\u00e6\u00f0: Beo\u00f0 a\u00fewegene & \u00feurhwunia\u00fe cl\u00e6ne.\nSo\u00f0lice se bi\u00f0 a\u00fewegen & wuna\u00fe cl\u00e6ne se \u00f0e \u00fea for\u00fegewitenan synna bewepe\u00f0, & he eft \u00fea\nAc se bi\u00f0 \u00fewegen & ne bi\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne se \u00f0e wep\u00fe \u00fea \u00f0urhtogenan synna & hie \u00feeah \u00feonne gyt ne forl\u00e6te\u00f0,\nTo witanne is so\u00f0lice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 sio so\u00f0e hreowsung sio \u00feurh wisnesse bi\u00f0 gedon.\nSio so\u00f0e hreowsung ne bi\u00f0 na on \u00feara geara rime gescrifen, ac on \u00fe\u00e6s modes biternesse.\nFor \u00feam God ne sec\u00f0 na swa swi\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6ra tida lenge, ac he \u00feenc\u00f0 hu mycel sio lufu sie \u00fe\u00e6re\nWitodlice, \u00feeah \u00fee hwa sie synfull & arleas, gif he to hreowsunga gecyrran wille, ne tweoge him\nSo\u00f0lice \u00fea \u00fee on \u00feisse worulde hreowsunge do\u00f0, \u00feam simle Godes mildheortnes gehelp\u00f0.\n\u00deam hreowsiendan is sio w\u00e6cce witodlice to beganne, for \u00feam \u00fee hio to heofonum up ahef\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s\nFor \u00feam us gedafena\u00fe wacian symle, swa swa Esaias se witega cw\u00e6\u00f0: Of \u00fe\u00e6re nihte min gast waca\u00fe to\nEft Dauid cw\u00e6\u00f0, se witiga: Media nocte surgebam, To middere nihte ic w\u00e6s arisende \u00fee to andettanne\nBe \u00fe\u00e6re w\u00e6ccan eac swylce se h\u00e6lend \u00feara tolysendra mod aweahte, \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende: Beatus ille seruus\nTo so\u00f0an ic eow secge, ofer eall is god geset.\n& eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ic lufige \u00fea \u00fee me lufia\u00f0, & \u00fea \u00fee \u00e6r to me wacia\u00fe, \u00fea gemeta\u00fe me.\nWacia\u00fe, for \u00f0y, an gyrnesse, for \u00feam ge nyton hw\u00e6nne dryhten cumende bi\u00f0, on repsunge o\u00f0\u00f0e to\n& n\u00e6s na \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0am apostolum sylfum \u00feas lare bebead.\n\u00dea w\u00e6ccan he eft gecydde, \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende: \u00feeah ic eow \u00fea w\u00e6ccan beode, eallum ic hie beode.\nTo witanne is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t nis \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t an wordum he l\u00e6rde \u00fea w\u00e6ccan, ac eac swylce mid his agenre\nBro\u00f0or mine, for \u00fean is eallum geleaffullum mannum to wacienne, for \u00feam \u00fee sio estfulnes \u00fe\u00e6re\nFor \u00feam hie witon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t nis idellic \u00e6r to arisenne & \u00e6r leohte to wacienne, for \u00feam dryhten gehet\n\u00c6fter \u00feissum gehyhtlice fylga\u00f0 \u00fea f\u00e6stenu, be \u00feara lofum Isidorius cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00de\u00e6t f\u00e6sten sie swi\u00f0e god;\n\u00de\u00e6t f\u00e6sten, se \u00f0e hit rihtlice beg\u00e6\u00f0, he bi\u00f0 to Gode ge\u00feydd, & he bi\u00f0 \u00feissum middangearde afremdod,\n\u00deurh \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten bio\u00f0 \u00fea leahtras astreahte, & \u00fe\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc bi\u00f0 geea\u00f0med & \u00fe\u00e6s diofles costung\nHieronimus cwi\u00f0: \u00de\u00e6t f\u00e6sten gecl\u00e6nsa\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6ne lichoman & gemidla\u00f0 \u00fea uncysta, & \u00fea godcundan\nAgustinus cw\u00e6\u00f0: \u00de\u00e6t f\u00e6sten geopena\u00fe \u00fea heofonlican gerynu & ut ascyf\u00f0 \u00fea yflan leahtras & \u00fea sawle\nWitodlice \u00fea f\u00e6stenu sint strange gescotu angean \u00fe\u00e6s diofles costungum.\nSwi\u00f0e ra\u00fee hie bio\u00f0 oferswi\u00f0de \u00feurh \u00fea forh\u00e6fdnesse.\nSo\u00f0lice to witanne is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t f\u00e6sten myclum frama\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t folc on Niniuen \u00fe\u00e6re byrig gef\u00e6ston\nIsrahela folc gef\u00e6ston \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re Easterlican symbelnesse, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t hie geearnodon \u00fea Readan S\u00e6\nMoyses gef\u00e6ste on \u00feam westenne, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode gehyran \u00fea heofonlican geryno.\nDauid se cyning \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feurhtogenan synne gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode \u00fea ylcan scylde\nCrist sylf gef\u00e6ste xl daga & xl nihta, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he oferswi\u00f0de \u00feone wi\u00f0erwinnan, & him sona englas\nPetrus gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode \u00feone engel geseon, se hine of \u00feam carcernne alysde.\nIohannes se godspellere gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode \u00fea godcundan gerynu gehyran, swa him se\nPaulus gef\u00e6ste, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t he geearnode bion geh\u00e6led of \u00fe\u00e6re blindnesse & fulluhtes onfon.\nHieronimus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Swa lange swa Adam hine geh\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6ples ne abyrgde, he wunude on\nSona swa he \u00fe\u00e6s of\u00e6tes on\u00feah, swa w\u00e6s he drifen.\nBro\u00f0or \u00fea leofestan, swi\u00f0e god is \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten mid gebede.\nFor \u00feam sio gemetf\u00e6stnes is halwendlic, & swa hw\u00e6t swa bi\u00f0 to swi\u00f0e & ofer gemet, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0\nTo witanne is weotodlice \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten mid godum worcum is Gode swi\u00f0e andfenge.\nFor \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t fulfremede f\u00e6sten \u00fe\u00e6t mid \u00e6lmessan & mid gebedum \u00feone heofon \u00feurhf\u00e6r\u00f0, & to\n\u00c6fter \u00feam f\u00e6stenne, bro\u00f0or mine, synt \u00fea f\u00e6stenu to beganne, swa swa Isidorius cw\u00e6\u00f0: Mid \u00feam\nSo\u00f0lice to witane is \u00fe\u00e6tte singallice gebed myclum frema\u00fe mid Gode, swa swa Paulus se apostol\nWeotodlice Moyses hine geb\u00e6d & he ahwyrfde Godes yrre fram Israhela folce, \u00fea hie hie to \u00f0am\nEac swylce Elias hine geb\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t hit ne rinde ofer eor\u00f0an, & he mid his gebedum \u00feone heofon beleac\nIonas hine geb\u00e6d on \u00fe\u00e6s hw\u00e6les inno\u00f0e & he \u00feanon alysed w\u00e6s.\nDaniel hine geb\u00e6d on \u00fe\u00e6ra leona sea\u00fee & geearnode beon gehyred.\nEzechias se cyning hine geb\u00e6d on his untrumnesse & him geicte God XV gear to life.\nWiotodlice swa hwa swa wile symle mid Gode bion, he sceal gelomlice hine gebiddan & r\u00e6dan.\nFor \u00feam \u00feonne we us gebidda\u00fe, \u00feonne spreca\u00fe we wi\u00f0 God, & \u00feonne we r\u00ebda\u00fe, \u00feonne spric\u00fe God wi\u00f0\n\u00c6t \u00feam ytemestan, bro\u00f0or mine, her\u00e6fter fylg\u00f0 sio manung be \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6lmessan, sio is fylness &\nBe \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6lmessan lofe Agustinus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sio \u00e6lmesse is swi\u00f0e halig weorc.\nHio geic\u00f0 \u00feas andweardan god, & hio syl\u00f0 synna forgifnesse, & hio gemanigfealda\u00fe geara fyrstas, &\nSwa swa Hieronimus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sio \u00e6lmesse geondf\u00e6r\u00f0 \u00feone heofon & hio cnysse\u00f0 heofona rices duru,\nWitodlice, \u00fereo cyn synt \u00e6lmessena: an is lichamlic, \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00feam w\u00e6dliendan sylle to gode\n\u00deas \u00feing us gedafena\u00f0 gefellan mid \u00fe\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes fultume \u00fee mid f\u00e6der & mid suna & mid \u00feam \u00feam",
